 1:{title:'Fundamentals of Electric Circuits',sub:'Nodes and branches, charge and voltage, sources, power, Kirchhoff’s laws, Ohm’s law, and the node-voltage and mesh-current methods.',range:'§§1.1–1.9 · printed pp. 4–62',problems:'End-of-chapter problems · printed pp. 63–78'}
